<blockquote>
<p>Installing any version of Kicksecure 18 and fully updating it leads to a system which is (<a href="https://www.kicksecure.com/wiki/Operating_System_Software_and_Updates#Update_vs_Image_Re-Installation" title="Operating System Software and Updates">mostly</a>) identical to installing a Kicksecure point release.</p>
<p>If the Kicksecure installation is <a href="https://www.kicksecure.com/wiki/Update" title="Update">updated</a>, no further action is required.</p>
</blockquote>
